{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-server-api-docs",
  "category": "layout",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-server-api-docs&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Documentación interactiva de la API de un server: valida su documento con Zod, lo pinta sobre el layout documental y deja probar cada operación con sesión.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-server-api-docs",
  "loads": [
    "iswc-doc-layout",
    "iswc-doc-index",
    "iswc-pager",
    "iswc-md-render",
    "iswc-code",
    "iswc-tag",
    "iswc-spinner",
    "iswc-copy-button",
    "iswc-button",
    "iswc-button-group",
    "iswc-icon",
    "iswc-input",
    "iswc-dialog",
    "iswc-callout"
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "El server publica su documento (InSoft <code class=\"code\">kind:\"config\"</code> u OpenAPI 3) y la página solo monta la etiqueta: aquí el documento va en un <code class=\"code\">script type=\"application/json\"</code> hijo; también se asigna por propiedad (<code class=\"code\">el.doc = obj</code>) o se pide por <code class=\"code\">src</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-server-api-docs api-base=\"https://ayudascp-ia-staging.azurewebsites.net/api\" style=\"height: 620px\">",
            "  <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "    {",
            "      \"kind\": \"config\",",
            "      \"version\": 1,",
            "      \"info\": {",
            "        \"title\": \"API PatyIA\",",
            "        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",",
            "        \"description\": \"Documentación de la API del ISS PatyIA (documento de ejemplo).\\n\\n<iswc-callout color=\\\"info\\\" icon=\\\"mdi:information-outline\\\">Inicie sesión con su usuario del portal para probar los endpoints protegidos: el visor envía el Bearer al pulsar **Enviar**.</iswc-callout>\\n\\n### Secciones\\n\\n| Área | Contenido |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| **Conversaciones** | Turno del chat y detalle |\\n| **Sistema** | Configuración y esta documentación |\"",
            "      },",
            "      \"viewer\": {",
            "        \"ns\": \"ISS\",",
            "        \"brand\": {",
            "          \"title\": \"ISS PatyIA\",",
            "          \"icon\": \"mdi:robot-outline\"",
            "        },",
            "        \"auth\": {",
            "          \"enabled\": true,",
            "          \"loginKind\": \"portal\",",
            "          \"loginPath\": \"/auth/portal-login\",",
            "          \"app\": \"isa-patyia\",",
            "          \"provider\": \"patyia-portal\"",
            "        },",
            "        \"exports\": {",
            "          \"openApiDownloadName\": \"iss-ayudascpia.openapi.json\",",
            "          \"postmanDownloadName\": \"iss-ayudascpia.postman_collection.json\",",
            "          \"isDownloadName\": \"iss-ayudascpia.is.json\"",
            "        },",
            "        \"nav\": [",
            "          {",
            "            \"id\": \"conversaciones\",",
            "            \"label\": \"Conversaciones\",",
            "            \"icon\": \"mdi:forum-outline\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Conversaciones\"",
            "            ]",
            "          },",
            "          {",
            "            \"id\": \"sistema\",",
            "            \"label\": \"Sistema\",",
            "            \"icon\": \"mdi:heart-pulse\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Sistema\"",
            "            ]",
            "          }",
            "        ],",
            "        \"servers\": [",
            "          {",
            "            \"url\": \"https://ayudascp-ia-staging.azurewebsites.net/api\",",
            "            \"description\": \"Staging (Azure)\"",
            "          },",
            "          {",
            "            \"url\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8802/api\",",
            "            \"description\": \"Local (Functions)\"",
            "          }",
            "        ]",
            "      },",
            "      \"tags\": [",
            "        {",
            "          \"name\": \"Conversaciones\",",
            "          \"description\": \"Chat y detalle de conversaciones.\",",
            "          \"subgroups\": [",
            "            {",
            "              \"id\": \"chat\",",
            "              \"name\": \"Chat\",",
            "              \"icon\": \"mdi:forum-outline\",",
            "              \"description\": \"Turno SSE y detalle.\"",
            "            }",
            "          ]",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"name\": \"Sistema\",",
            "          \"description\": \"Configuración, salud y documentación.\",",
            "          \"subgroups\": [",
            "            {",
            "              \"id\": \"configuracion\",",
            "              \"name\": \"Configuración\",",
            "              \"icon\": \"mdi:cog-outline\",",
            "              \"description\": \"GET/PUT /sistema/cfg.\"",
            "            },",
            "            {",
            "              \"id\": \"documentacion\",",
            "              \"name\": \"Documentación\",",
            "              \"icon\": \"mdi:file-code-outline\",",
            "              \"description\": \"GET /docs.\"",
            "            }",
            "          ]",
            "        }",
            "      ],",
            "      \"paths\": {",
            "        \"/sistema/cfg\": {",
            "          \"get\": {",
            "            \"summary\": \"Ver la configuración del sistema\",",
            "            \"description\": \"Lee la fila runtime de SYS_VALUES.\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Sistema\"",
            "            ],",
            "            \"subgroup\": \"configuracion\",",
            "            \"security\": \"bearer\",",
            "            \"doc\": \"sistema-cfg\",",
            "            \"responses\": {",
            "              \"template\": \"ok\",",
            "              \"description\": \"Config SYS_VALUES.runtime\",",
            "              \"payload\": \"sistema-cfg\"",
            "            }",
            "          },",
            "          \"put\": {",
            "            \"summary\": \"Guardar la configuración del sistema\",",
            "            \"description\": \"Push parcial sobre la fila runtime.\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Sistema\"",
            "            ],",
            "            \"subgroup\": \"configuracion\",",
            "            \"security\": \"bearer\",",
            "            \"doc\": \"sistema-cfg-put\",",
            "            \"requestBody\": {",
            "              \"bodyKey\": \"sistema-cfg-put\",",
            "              \"description\": \"Claves a cambiar.\",",
            "              \"schema\": {",
            "                \"type\": \"object\",",
            "                \"properties\": {",
            "                  \"convlog\": {",
            "                    \"type\": \"boolean\"",
            "                  }",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            },",
            "            \"responses\": {",
            "              \"template\": \"authForbidden\",",
            "              \"description\": \"SYS_VALUES.runtime actualizado\",",
            "              \"payload\": \"sistema-cfg\"",
            "            },",
            "            \"tryitConfirm\": \"sistema-cfg-put\"",
            "          }",
            "        },",
            "        \"/conversacion/{iconversacion}\": {",
            "          \"get\": {",
            "            \"summary\": \"Detalle de una conversación\",",
            "            \"description\": \"Mensajes y estado.\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Conversaciones\"",
            "            ],",
            "            \"subgroup\": \"chat\",",
            "            \"security\": \"bearer\",",
            "            \"doc\": \"conversacion-detalle\",",
            "            \"parameters\": [",
            "              {",
            "                \"name\": \"iconversacion\",",
            "                \"in\": \"path\",",
            "                \"required\": true,",
            "                \"schema\": {",
            "                  \"type\": \"string\"",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            ],",
            "            \"responses\": {",
            "              \"template\": \"authNotFound\",",
            "              \"description\": \"Conversación\",",
            "              \"payload\": \"conversacion\"",
            "            }",
            "          },",
            "          \"delete\": {",
            "            \"summary\": \"Eliminar una conversación\",",
            "            \"description\": \"Borra la conversación propia.\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Conversaciones\"",
            "            ],",
            "            \"subgroup\": \"chat\",",
            "            \"security\": \"bearer\",",
            "            \"doc\": \"conversacion-detalle\",",
            "            \"parameters\": [",
            "              {",
            "                \"name\": \"iconversacion\",",
            "                \"in\": \"path\",",
            "                \"required\": true,",
            "                \"schema\": {",
            "                  \"type\": \"string\"",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            ],",
            "            \"responses\": {",
            "              \"template\": \"deleteEnvelope\",",
            "              \"description\": \"Fila eliminada\",",
            "              \"schema\": \"conversacion-row\",",
            "              \"payload\": \"conversacion\"",
            "            }",
            "          }",
            "        },",
            "        \"/conversacion\": {",
            "          \"post\": {",
            "            \"summary\": \"Enviar un turno (SSE)\",",
            "            \"description\": \"Responde con text/event-stream.\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Conversaciones\"",
            "            ],",
            "            \"subgroup\": \"chat\",",
            "            \"security\": \"bearer\",",
            "            \"doc\": \"conversacion-sse\",",
            "            \"requestBody\": {",
            "              \"bodyKey\": \"turno\",",
            "              \"required\": true,",
            "              \"description\": \"Prompt y, si existe, iconversacion.\"",
            "            },",
            "            \"responses\": {",
            "              \"template\": \"raw\",",
            "              \"items\": {",
            "                \"200\": {",
            "                  \"description\": \"text/event-stream: begin · message · end\",",
            "                  \"example\": \"event: message\\ndata: {}\\n\\n\"",
            "                },",
            "                \"401\": {",
            "                  \"description\": \"Sin sesión\"",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            },",
            "            \"tryitAttachments\": \"conversacion\"",
            "          }",
            "        },",
            "        \"/docs\": {",
            "          \"get\": {",
            "            \"summary\": \"Visor de la API\",",
            "            \"description\": \"HTML con el visor; ?v=json devuelve este documento.\",",
            "            \"tags\": [",
            "              \"Sistema\"",
            "            ],",
            "            \"subgroup\": \"documentacion\",",
            "            \"security\": \"none\",",
            "            \"doc\": \"docs\",",
            "            \"responses\": {",
            "              \"template\": \"raw\",",
            "              \"items\": {",
            "                \"200\": {",
            "                  \"description\": \"text/html (visor) · ?v=json · ?v=md · ?v=routes\"",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            }",
            "          }",
            "        }",
            "      },",
            "      \"catalog\": {",
            "        \"docs\": {",
            "          \"sistema-cfg\": \"## Configuración\\n\\nLee `SYS_VALUES.runtime`.\\n\\n```http\\nGET /api/sistema/cfg\\n```\\n\",",
            "          \"sistema-cfg-put\": \"## Guardar\\n\\nPush parcial validado con Zod.\",",
            "          \"conversacion-detalle\": \"## Detalle\\n\\nDevuelve la conversación si es del usuario.\",",
            "          \"conversacion-sse\": \"## Turno\\n\\nEventos `begin`, `message`, `end`.\",",
            "          \"docs\": \"## Visor\\n\\nEste mismo documento, servido como HTML.\"",
            "        },",
            "        \"payloads\": {",
            "          \"sistema-cfg\": {",
            "            \"convlog\": true,",
            "            \"clean_convlog\": 30",
            "          },",
            "          \"conversacion\": {",
            "            \"iconversacion\": \"c-1\",",
            "            \"mensajes\": []",
            "          }",
            "        },",
            "        \"requestBodies\": {",
            "          \"sistema-cfg-put\": {",
            "            \"convlog\": false",
            "          },",
            "          \"turno\": {",
            "            \"prompt\": \"Hola\"",
            "          }",
            "        },",
            "        \"schemas\": {",
            "          \"conversacion-row\": {",
            "            \"type\": \"object\",",
            "            \"properties\": {",
            "              \"iconversacion\": {",
            "                \"type\": \"string\"",
            "              }",
            "            }",
            "          }",
            "        },",
            "        \"tryitConfirm\": {",
            "          \"sistema-cfg-put\": {",
            "            \"title\": \"Guardar configuración\",",
            "            \"message\": \"Cambia la configuración del sistema.\"",
            "          }",
            "        },",
            "        \"tryitAttachments\": {",
            "          \"templates\": {",
            "            \"conversacion\": {",
            "              \"images\": {",
            "                \"field\": \"imagenes\"",
            "              }",
            "            }",
            "          }",
            "        }",
            "      }",
            "    }",
            "  </script>",
            "</iswc-server-api-docs>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:api-base",
              "label": "api-base (servidor de «Probar»)",
              "options": [
                "https://ayudascp-ia-staging.azurewebsites.net/api",
                "http://127.0.0.1:8802/api"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "ejemplos": {
        "content": [
          "```html",
          "<!-- Página que sirve el server en GET /api/docs: solo el kit por CDN, pin por SHA. -->",
          "<script type=\"module\">",
          "  const { ISWebComponentsLoader: L } = await import('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Jeff-Aporta/is-webcomponents@<sha40>/dist/cdn/core/loader.min.js');",
          "  await L.loadPageStyles(['iswc-palettes-default']);",
          "  await L.ensure('iswc-server-api-docs');",
          "</script>",
          "<iswc-server-api-docs style=\"height: 100dvh\">",
          "  <script type=\"application/json\">{ \"kind\": \"config\", \"version\": 1, \"paths\": { … } }</script>",
          "</iswc-server-api-docs>",
          "```"
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": []
  }
}
